<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bill rates fall further at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bill rates fall further at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on Latvian Treasury bills fell further at auction on Wednesday in all maturities, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY     AVG YIELD   LAST WEEK   ISSUE   DEMAND  SOLD</p>
<p>  28-days	4.45	  6.35	  0.5    3.55    0.5</p>
<p>  Three month  5.92	  7.0	   0.5    3.76    0.5</p>
<p>  Six month    6.13	  7.84	  1.0    8.33    0.5</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
